## Saturday night

::bg{location="roof" time="night"}
::music{action="start" mood="romantic" volume="down"}
::use{component="enter" who="sol"}
@sol{emotion="shy"}: I rehearsed this on the night frequency. A trawler captain gave me notes.
@sol: Tomorrow there's the festival, and then there's a funicular, and then you're a name in the log. And I don't — I'd like to be a bit more than a column you filled in.
@sol{os}: Say something. Say anything. Say a pressure reading.

<branch id="solAnswer" prompt="The mast ticks. Below you, the village band starts up, badly.">
  <choice id="kiss" label="Kiss him">
    ::set{run.route = 'sol'}
    ::vfx{type="whiteOut"}
    @sol{emotion="laughing"}: Okay. Okay! That's — logging that. Oh-two-hundred, visibility unlimited.
  </choice>
  <choice id="friends" label="Tell him he'll always be in the log, but as a friend">
    @sol{emotion="sad"}: Yeah. No, that's — that's good. Friends is a good column.
  </choice>
</branch>
